WEBVTT

00:00:27.073 --> 00:00:30.165
Now, I've got no bucket of money today

00:00:30.189 --> 00:00:33.380
and I've got no policy to release,

00:00:33.404 --> 00:00:35.643
and I certainly haven't got a guitar.

00:00:35.667 --> 00:00:37.527
I'll leave that to others.

00:00:38.440 --> 00:00:40.122
But I do have an idea,

00:00:40.146 --> 00:00:42.764
and that idea is called
Housing for Health.

00:00:43.344 --> 00:00:46.037
Housing for Health works with poor people.

00:00:46.061 --> 00:00:49.092
It works in the places where they live,

00:00:49.116 --> 00:00:52.218
and the work is done
to improve their health.

00:00:53.049 --> 00:00:55.204
Over the last 28 years,

00:00:55.228 --> 00:00:58.656
this tough, grinding, dirty work

00:00:58.680 --> 00:01:03.141
has been done by literally
thousands of people around Australia